| Area | What to add / change | Why it matters |
|------|---------------------|----------------|
| Authentication | API key / JWT / session | Prevents unauthorized data access. |
| Authorization | Row‑level checks / tenant isolation | Avoids PII leaks in multi‑tenant systems. |
| HTTP Headers | `helmet` | Avoid XSS, click‑jacking, MIME sniffing. |
| CORS | Explicit policy | Stops arbitrary front‑ends from abusing the API. |
| Rate limiting | `express-rate-limit` | Defends against DoS and brute‑force scripts. |
